  "item_short_desc": "<p>The Soft Shell Tactical M-65 Field Jacket is a fusion of 2 iconic styles, combining the classic silhouette of a military field coat with the advanced weather protection of a soft shell jacket. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, this tactical field jacket shields you from harsh weather. The Soft Shell Waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. The high-performance fabric will help protect and keep you comfortable while braving the elements.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "4114",
  "description": "<p>The Soft Shell Tactical M-65 Field Jacket is a fusion of 2 iconic styles, combining the classic silhouette of a military field coat with the advanced weather protection of a soft shell jacket. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, this tactical field jacket shields you from harsh weather. The Soft Shell Waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. The high-performance fabric will help protect and keep you comfortable while braving the elements. Protection from the Elements: The weatherproof military field coat features a comfortable fleece lining that keeps you warm, ideal for outdoor operations, expeditions, and everyday wear. The concealed drawstring hood conveniently stores inside the collar and is easily accessible when needed. Storage Pockets: These warm outdoor M-65 jackets come equipped with 4 large-capacity snap-button cargo pockets (2 on the chest and 2 on the waist) for storing tactical gear and EDC essentials. Utility at the Forefront: The bi-swing back design lets you move with ease, allowing you to focus on the task at hand. The sturdy zipper closure with button-snap storm flap, adjustable wrist cuffs, interior waist drawcord, and drawstring bottom help keep the cold out and the heat in. Action Ready: From tactical professionals to adventurers, the soft shell military jacket is great for field missions, work, travel, outdoor activities, and more.</p>",
